%9A%84%E6%82%B2%E5%93%80\" title=\"小径/他者的悲哀\"><span class=\"span-link\" style=\"border-bottom-width:8px\"></span></a></div></div><div style=\"padding: 8px 4px; margin-bottom: -8px\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%B0%8F%E5%BE%84/%E4%B8%96%E7%BA%AA%E6%9C%AB%E5%B0%BA%E5%BA%A6\" title=\"小径/世纪末尺度\">世纪末尺度</a><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%B0%8F%E5%BE%84/%E4%B8%96%E7%BA%AA%E6%9C%AB%E5%B0%BA%E5%BA%A6\" title=\"小径/世纪末尺度\"><span class=\"span-link\" style=\"border-bottom-width:8px\"></span></a></div></div><div style=\"padding: 8px 4px; margin-bottom: -8px\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%B0%8F%E5%BE%84/%E8%81%9A%E5%90%88%E6%B5%AA%E6%BD%AE\" title=\"小径/聚合浪潮\">聚合浪潮</a><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%B0%8F%E5%BE%84/%E8%81%9A%E5%90%88%E6%B5%AA%E6%BD%AE\" title=\"小径/聚合浪潮\"><span class=\"span-link\" style=\"border-bottom-width:8px\"></span></a></div></div><div style=\"padding: 8px 4px; margin-bottom: -8px\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%B0%8F%E5%BE%84/%E9%87%8D%E7%87%83%EF%BC%81%E6%B5%81%E9%87%91%E4%B9%8B%E6%B5%B7\" title=\"小径/重燃！流金之海\">重燃！流金之海</a><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%B0%8F%E5%BE%84/%E9%87%8D%E7%87%83%EF%BC%81%E6%B5%81%E9%87%91%E4%B9%8B%E6%B5%B7\" title=\"小径/重燃！流金之海\"><span class=\"span-link\" style=\"border-bottom-width:8px\"></span></a></div></div></div><div class=\"trail-list\"><div class=\"trail-container\"><div id=\"小径①_目所能及的雨\"></div>\n<h2 style=\"display:none\"><span id=\".E5.B0.8F.E5.BE.84.E2.91.A0_.E7.9B.AE.E6.89.80.E8.83.BD.E5.8F.8A.E7.9A.84.E9.9B.A8\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"小径①_目所能及的雨\">小径① 目所能及的雨</span></h2><div class=\"trail-entrance\"><div class=\"trail-entrance--title serif\"><img alt=\"Zhuxianditu renwuicon 40.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/Zhuxianditu_renwuicon_40.png/20px-Zhuxianditu_renwuicon_40.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/Zhuxianditu_renwuicon_40.png/30px-Zhuxianditu_renwuicon_40.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/Zhuxianditu_renwuicon_40.png/40px-Zhuxianditu_renwuicon_40.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"48\" />小径① 目所能及的雨</div><div class=\"trail-icon hide-m\"><img alt=\"Fragmenticon-fragmenticon 059.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/60/Fragmenticon-fragmenticon_059.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"800\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"800\" data-file-height=\"800\" /></div></div><div class=\"trail-main\"><div class=\"trail-frame\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; top:0; left:0; overflow:hidden; border-radius:0 20px 0 0\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"hide-pc\" style=\"position:absolute; top:0; right:0; width:48%\"><img alt=\"Fragmenticon-fragmenticon 059.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/60/Fragmenticon-fragmenticon_059.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"800\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"800\" data-file-height=\"800\" /></div><div class=\"trail-title serif\">目所能及的雨</div><hr class=\"decorate\" /><div class=\"story no-indent\" style=\"position:relative;\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>只要多看看雨后的地面，您就能发现这道潮湿的、漫长的痕迹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>在痕迹尽头或许会有一只缓慢爬行的蜗牛，它为我们标识出何为“前方”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>可——如果没找见蜗牛呢？直线的哪一头才是前，哪一头又指向过去？</div></div><div class=\"tabber\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first style-choice\" style=\"margin:0 -3px 6px\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"storyselect\" data-storyselect=\"1\">需要更多依据</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"storyselect\" data-storyselect=\"2\">抱歉，我不知道</div></div><div class=\"tabber-item\" data-storyselect=\"1\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>您听听，依据。凡事都要找点儿道理和实例，进行缜密推演。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>眼见并非为实，合逻辑的才是正确的，切实的。因为还尚未有能动摇逻辑规律的东西存在，如果有——那只是缘于不够了解。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>曾经那群在罐头房子里忙碌的研究者们是如此认为的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>直到第一滴雨落下，他们猛然间发觉原有的认知已不足以自洽，就像破掉的窗户上那个巨大的空洞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>无论如何用木板、铁皮、防水布遮挡和修补，最终，一片狼藉中留下的仍旧只有这么扇摇摇欲坠的窗户。</div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item\" data-storyselect=\"2\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>喔！承认尚有不明白的事儿，接着费工夫弄懂它，您已经摸清了那群家伙的行事方式。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>那群在满地狼藉里费力地捡拾零件，希望尽力保留科技成果的研究者，眼瞅着浪潮将搭建好的沙堡冲刷，最后还原为散碎的沙砾。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>他们专注地做着记录，本以为自己所处的地方是个安全坚固的罐头，却发现四壁之中填充的同样是数不清的沙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>从落下的第一滴雨开始，熟悉的存在消失殆尽。</div></div></div><div class=\"tabber\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first style-choice\" style=\"margin:0 -3px 6px\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"storyselect\" data-storyselect=\"3\">然后呢？</div></div><div class=\"tabber-item\" data-storyselect=\"3\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>混乱不会持续太久。如果是突如其来的雨冲走了蜗牛，把时间搅得一塌糊涂……那么，反过来想——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>弄清雨的秘密，是否就能洞悉时间？在此前可没有这样好的案例，时间本该是个摸不着、瞧不见的概念。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>很快，观测站在世界各地冒了出来。以最快、最实用的方式，他们学会了采集与保存珍贵的研究材料，能盛放雨水的小盒子至今还在持续迭代。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>研究室重归整齐与寂静，每一枚齿轮都回到了原有的轨道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>能迅速了解这座臃肿、庞大、吱吱作响的机器的，终究也是机器。她并不倾向某一方，只追逐看得见的结果。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>所以，当那页报告——关于机器中某些忙着扑扇翅膀的，轻巧细小的零件，以及一张布满圈画与墨点的纸张被送到桌面时，她立刻做好了决定。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>——她毁去了报告，只让这些信息留在她的存储硬盘中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>而那张据称是“暴雨”发生地点预测的纸——上面的涂画就像蝴蝶眼斑——被她保存下来，和现有的研究结果进行比对。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>看样子结果使她很满意。</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [], "displaytitle": "小径/星"}}